<title>LATVIA: BOURSE INDEX UP 0.66 PERCENT TO 394.25.</title>
<headline>BOURSE INDEX UP 0.66 PERCENT TO 394.25.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Riga stock exchange said on Monday that its index rose to 394.25, up 2.58 points or 0.66 percent from Friday's close.</p>
<p>The bourse also said in a statement that total turnover came to 93,937 lats against Friday's 95,498 lats.</p>
<p>Full details will be released shortly.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 52 40</p>
